{"overview":"جزیره‌ای در جنوب ژاپن. «سوسوکه» پسر بچه‌ای پنج ساله است که همراه مادرش در خانه‌ای کوچک بالای صخره‌ای مشرف به یک شهر کوچک بندری زندگی می‌کند. او با یک ماهی قرمز کوچولوی دختر به نام «پونیو» دوستی پیدا می‌کند که آرزو دارد انسان بشود.","tagline":"به دنیایی که در آن هر چیزی ممکن است خوش آمدید.","overview_en":"When Sosuke, a young boy who lives on a clifftop overlooking the sea, rescues a stranded goldfish named Ponyo, he discovers more than he bargained for. Ponyo is a curious, energetic young creature who yearns to be human, but even as she causes chaos around the house, her father, a powerful sorcerer, schemes to return Ponyo to the sea.","tagline_en":"Welcome to a world where anything is possible.","runtime":100,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["هایائو میازاکی"],"crew_en":["Hayao Miyazaki"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"神月柚莉愛","role":"Ponyo (voice)","photo":"/tCI0CLCBXFme17d8aiyc7oxiwlC.jpg","en":"Yuria Kozuki"},{"name":"土井洋輝","role":"Sosuke (voice)","photo":"/zWcRrhmnXjJosEhAp9KJUBICqSW.jpg","en":"Hiroki Doi"},{"name":"所ジョージ","role":"Fujimoto (voice)","photo":"/bndtzl3ghsdYqjgGqsmp4oUtxtw.jpg","en":"George Tokoro"},{"name":"山口智子","role":"Risa (voice)","photo":"/a6g8bSRKeKkFR7A1NP7mMTG3VSe.jpg","en":"Tomoko Yamaguchi"},{"name":"یوکی آمامی","role":"Gran Mamare (voice)","photo":"/h5OODF0k6lOomoA6T4BzyqFTcdL.jpg","en":"Yuki Amami"},{"name":"長嶋一茂","role":"Koichi (voice)","photo":"/vfC3O4DPPXI5RWnUmne1w25uOJf.jpg","en":"Kazushige Nagashima"},{"name":"矢野顕子","role":"Ponyo's Sister (voice)","photo":"/hvxKBkHN0ycCRR5agukqq0bgldL.jpg","en":"Akiko Yano"},{"name":"羽鳥慎一","role":"Anchorman (voice)","photo":"/hU5C3QKuzZH1kTeuPCgjYds6EXk.jpg","en":"Shin'ichi Hatori"},{"name":"左時枝","role":"Kayo (voice)","photo":"/fBWvSwfL8ur5TTREAndHnVfUsq8.jpg","en":"Tokie Hidari"},{"name":"柊瑠美","role":"Young Mother (voice)","photo":"/nTKM4GgfkrZvAOFL55uhEuckt7M.jpg","en":"Rumi Hiiragi"},{"name":"نارائوکا توموکو","role":"Yoshie (voice)","photo":"/yDm0C5VLUZ6